<title>ESTONIA: UHIS TRADED ON FRANKFURT BOURSE.</title>
<headline>UHIS TRADED ON FRANKFURT BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uhispank said on Thursday its shares are being traded on the free market of the Frankfurt bourse and have been since March 7.</p>
<p>&quot;The shares have been traded there since March 7,&quot; Uhispank capital markets dealer Aivo Kangus told Reuters.</p>
<p>Uhispank shares are also traded on the free market of the Munich bourse and on the OTC market of the Helsinki bourse.</p>
<p>Hansapank's shares are also traded on the three foreign bourses.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
